  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 404.10 Operating Restrictions",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-12-05",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 404.10 Operating Restrictions. All vessels leaving Back Bay Channel on Lake Winnipesaukee in the town of Wolfeboro shall have the right-of-way from all vessels, except for canoes, rowboats and sailboats entering the channel, pursuant to RSA 270-D:2, IX.\n\nSource. #7305, EMERGENCY, eff 6-9-00, EXPIRED: 10-7-00\n\nNew. #7502, EMERGENCY, eff 6-8-01, EXPIRES:12-5-01; ss by #7534, eff 7-25-01; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 404.09); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
